    },
    {
      "id": "claim_5bdae10e9d00442aa67bc8fe40bf5536",
      "statement": "The log tier's replication unit is the captured-but-not-yet-uploaded L0 segment (ShipEntry), streamed to a small follower ensemble over the signed peer transport, and followers keep each session's durable appends under <root>/peerlog/<node>/<generation>/.",
