    {
      "id": "claim_791e290196ea40af8f3a58c23497a7df",
      "statement": "Replication concurrency is bounded: SYNC_CONCURRENCY caps per-cell uploads, RESTORE_DOWNLOAD_CONCURRENCY bounds aggregate restores, and CELLD_LTX_TRUNCATE_PAGES (default 128) truncates an ordinary cell's WAL at the next checkpoint while Queue cells use passive checkpoints because a truncate boundary emits a full database image.",
